  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "The least positive integral value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math>, for which the angle between the vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is acute, is _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math> is acute,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So, the least positive integral value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
